@startuml F5.6-ERRO-01-conflito-grr
title F5.6-ERRO-01 — 409 conflito de GRR ou CPF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "StudentController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar aluno
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /academico/alunos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT
Postgres --> Ctrl: 23505 unique_violation
Ctrl --> WebApp: 409 conflict
WebApp --> Sec: erro inline no campo

@enduml
